hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1467","Ali bin Muslim told us, Hushaym told us, Mansour, who is Ibn Zazan, told us, on the authority of Ibn Sirin, on the authority of Umm Atiyya, and Hisham, on the authority of Ibn Sirin, and Hafsa, on the authority of Umm Atiyya: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to bring out virgins, those who were free of age, those who had maidens, And menstruating on the day of Eid. As for menstruating women, they isolate themselves from the prayer place and witness goodness and invite the Muslims. One of them said: If not Does one of us have a jilbab? He said: “Let her sister show her some of her cloak.”"
